# Academic Pipeline - Cron Examples
# Copie as linhas desejadas para seu crontab (crontab -e)
# O pipeline roda em /home/bianca/academic-pipeline-gf

# =============================================================================
# VARIÁVEIS DE AMBIENTE (defina no topo do crontab ou no .bashrc)
# =============================================================================
# PATH=/home/bianca/academic-pipeline-gf/.venv/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
# HOME=/home/bianca
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=seu_token
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=seu_chat_id

# =============================================================================
# AGENDAMENTO (exemplos — descomente a linha desejada)
# =============================================================================

# Diário às 12h: coleta + alertas acadêmicos
# 0 12 * * * cd /home/bianca/academic-pipeline-gf && .venv/bin/python -m main academic collect >> logs/academic_collect.log 2>&1
# 5 12 * * * cd /home/bianca/academic-pipeline-gf && .venv/bin/python -m main academic alert --channel both >> logs/academic_alert.log 2>&1

# Ou use o run_weekly.sh via anacron (recomendado):
#   7  20  pipeline.semanal  runuser -u bianca -- /home/bianca/academic-pipeline-gf/run_weekly.sh
